      <title>Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation is part of The Big Give - Can you Help?</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">42981504</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/28fd880</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #DCDCDC; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#DCDCDC"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="padding: 0px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/06/3435093/biggive2020email_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="BigGive2020Header" width="600" height="300"></td></tr></table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation is part of The Big Give - Can you Help?</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Join us in celebrating the establishment of the Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation - a (501(c)(3) - by donating to the Big Give! The Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation works hand-in-hand with the Columbus Recreation and Parks Department and community volunteers to ensure all residents have access to recreational programs, facilities, places and spaces that make our lives and communities great.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>The Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation has teamed up with The Columbus Foundation for its Big Give on June 10.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">The Big Give is a one-day online giving event to provide critical financial support to area nonprofits. The Columbus Foundation and its donors have provided a $1.5 million Bonus Pool to be amplified on a prorated basis across all gifts made during The Big Give. <strong>This means your donation will be automatically increased by the bonus pool.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">If you are able, please consider making a donation to the Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation during The Big Give. The money will be donated to the Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation’s PLAY Grant Program. This program provides sports opportunities to financially challenged children in Columbus.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Last year, over 3,000 vulnerable kids were able to participate in the department’s programs such as soccer, tennis, gymnastics, football and more thanks to donations from this community. <strong><em>We know the need will be even greater this coming year. </em></strong></p>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">If you are able, please make your tax-deductible donation <a href="https://bit.ly/BigGiveCRPFoundation?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">online</a> and help kids in this community. </p>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
  <tr class="gd_combo_first_image">
    <td class="gd_combo_image_cell" width="265"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?fbclid=IwAR0xxzk1xFUI63YZ3xsHmUcJzDHKy0k4AVONHUbFcfNGmejzzZVJO3qwKgw&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&v=1jgnYTmKDlk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Family Karate" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/06/3435373/biggivevideo_original.jpg" style="width: 265px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="BigGiveVideoPrev" width="265" height="138"></a></td>
<td class="gd_combo_spacer" width="4"></td>
<td class="gd_combo_text_cell"><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">For the Webster family, karate was a family affair. Click on the image to watch a video about how this dad and his sons were all able to learn karate thanks to funds provided by the Columbus Recreation and Parks Foundation<a href="https://www.facebook.com/crpfoundation/?__cft__%5B0%5D=AZU2tDFFDp3nndg7wo1Zbwy6PC60meoaoYpodo5dBMaDz8wW1Lay6t8PUaaQR5UgQEdWqN1MsyHB83t_VIjoFNlyWkvl_qFc-qnT4u1K6R_dYB1S1u5sRVzsJ1IPBE-JSpxDsKxz0O1yXkjWkh1r_UsravOCjxH3xG2jb8MVCTUMQA&__tn__=kK-R&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" class="oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl oo9gr5id gpro0wi8 lrazzd5p" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"></a>.</p></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<div class="govd_hr"><div class="govd_hr_inner"><hr></div></div>
