<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Listen to SportsTalk Columbus</h1>
<a href="https://sportstalkcolumbus.podbean.com/e/doug-hare-central-ohio-youth-baseball-league/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="SportsTalk Columbus Podcast" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/04/3285146/podcast-icon-02_original.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="SportsTalk Columbus Podcast " width="560" height="144"></a><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/sportstalk-columbus-podcast/id1504940909?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="SportsTalk Columbus Podcast" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/04/3285307/listen-on-apple_original.png" style="width: 163px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Apple Podcasts" width="163" height="35"></a><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/26J47vJlHhu4k13LmswkKZ?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="SportsTalk Columbus Podcast" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2020/04/3285311/listen-on-spotify_original.png" style="width: 104px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Spotify" width="104" height="41"></a><p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><br>In episode two of SportTalk Columbus, we sat down with Doug Hare, tournament director and CEO of one the largest baseball leagues in Ohio, Central Ohio Youth Baseball League. Starting in 1998, COYBL grew to over 400 teams at its peak and hosts tournaments like Coaches Against MM (Multiple Myeloma), which has raised over $250,000 for cancer research at The James Cancer Hospital part of The Ohio State University Hospitals.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Episode Sponsor - <a href="https://fieldsourceohio.com/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Field Source</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="http://crpdsports.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Show-Notes.pdf?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" title="SportsTalk Columbus Podcast Show Notes" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Episode Show Notes</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="http://crpdsports.org/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Columbus Recreation and Parks Sports Office</a></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Intro and Exit Music: <a href="https://freemusicarchive.org/music/XTaKeRuX/The_way_iam/Rocking_Forward_?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Rocking Forward</a> by <a href="https://freemusicarchive.org/music/XTaKeRuX?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">XTaKeRuX</a> and is used under a <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">CC BY 4.0 International license</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">We are proud to present SportsTalk Columbus, brought to you by the partnership between B.A.T.S. and Columbus Recreation and Parks Sports Office. Our mission is to engage with the Sports Community of Central Ohio off the field by being a leader in the sports community by providing insights and commentary by industry experts.</p>
